q9tMGcFQYrXYzZsibia62pWVvOAROiaILHIGhI4xg6IMSnLl6xPko/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span> 2026.07.06-07.10</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pAu73qpwgGkLtJqLibnKaD8NGlyofT1m2Tv51HiagCEv6cmCt7CY01tAu5icwiaOia9QfumHe5MB1v7A7K0z30zO3rZa0cQEjPRPy7nqlp018oV8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>上海海事大学经济管理学院</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2026年优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为搭建上海海事大学经济管理学院与各高校优秀大学生之间沟通的桥梁，优质学术交流与人才蓄水池，学生与研究生导师之间的互动平台，增进各高校考生对我院学科、学位点建设及研究生培养情况的了解，深度感受上海海事大学经管类专业风采，我院相关学科专业将举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGlv0GQXkSfZnoj5iaIl3w3ciagZtRGAEmIViaIJxcTHaUqZaxWIXsFrRJaI7NgicGzvk2bkTuc0RSabwsr8nAZq8QpnduwIGRE2IcQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.品德优良、遵纪守法，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正，全国高校2027届本科毕业生，符合硕士研究生招生报考条件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.有意向申报我院2027年推荐免试研究生或报考我院2027年硕士研究生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.具备良好的英语基础，对经济管理类专业有浓厚的兴趣；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.有较好的创新能力、团队组织能力和沟通能力。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGkicJnImMdvf21TW2ZiaoCf9RSTxAoL9vF8BTCl5YqBWXkdrLhjEUiafqq9v6Bnxst1zTicyFMyY3rbgUDlVAenHqEicaN2lUOUFabE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）报名时间</span></span></p><p><span><span>网上申请时间：</span></span></p><p><span><span>即日起至6月21日16：00</span></span></p><p><span><span>夏令营活动时间：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年7月6日----7月10日（共五天）</span></span></p><p><span><span>活动地点：上海海事大学临港校区（上海市浦东新区海港大道1550号）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）报名方式</span></span></p><p><span><span>网上报名地址：https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10254/user/login/login</span></span></p><p><span><span>全日制项目考生在上海海事大学夏令营管理系统注册后进行网上报名，请按系统要求如实填写申请信息；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）报名材料</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者获得入营资格后，来学校报到时需提交相关纸质版材料，包括：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.《上海海事大学“优秀大学生夏令营”申请表》（获得入营资格后，在报考系统内点击确认入营并下载）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.有效居民身份证正反面复印件和学信网近期下载的《教育部学籍在线验证报告》；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本科成绩单（申请者只需提供前5学期成绩即可）与总评成绩排名证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.外语水平证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.其他证明材料复印件（如已发表论文、其他获奖或资格证书）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>特别提醒:报名考生须对所提交材料的真实性负责，若发现存在材料虚假等情况，一经核实，将取消学员资格、优秀学员资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）夏令营招生专业</span></span></p><p><span><span>学硕：管理科学与工程、应用经济学、工商管理学（含会计）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>专硕：金融、应用统计、会计。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动内容</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGm9ZjO4NkN3zTVsTxHa0v2LMpnaNwBMOGFNOx4gcicKibOrSENMHZaIkzJJDaDI86j9gbGwPvQB3UTmIQIFADOv3ibr6xo87X5lhE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>学生报到、夏令营开营仪式、素质拓展破冰、学位点介绍、学校招生政策宣讲、商科主题学术讲座、航运实践活动、党建活动（中共一大会址）及现场考察（临港片区及其他知名航运企业走访参观）、在读硕博士交流沙龙等。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>计划人数</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGmAfiaHpfV1zODaCD4WUoHddZ07McHAib0jvQ1wqX7bicURUG7clp6AQiaRHto7r6hxAfGkc1BFDGcqib3NHKTpT7Qkv9lMF3gvKDFw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院计划招募25名全日制项目学员，学院将对申请人资格进行审核。审核通过的学员名单将于6月25日在学院官网和微信公众号“上海海事大学经济管理学院”公布，并直接通知学员本人（以电话或电子邮件形式）。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学校为学员提供以下保障</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGnMHs9rvlpMd4YTJ2HEITQ6nRzLOgYuFQwUF7cPyhIcvhZlmZP90vgr5FfX9AwOibx65xOfcBS46QV8ZNNiaf3uibwgSicyqSUyT6E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.夏令营期间给全日制相关专业学员统一安排住宿，统一购买夏令营活动期间的团体意外保险。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.为全程参加夏令营活动的全日制相关专业学员提供1000元生活补贴及伙食补贴。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.全程参与本次夏令营的外地全日制相关专业学员，可凭有效交通票据报销往返路费，报销标准统一按高铁二等座核算；出行始发、返程地点仅限学校所在地或事前报备的常住地。上海本地全日制相关专业学员，统一发放 100 元交通补贴。请各位学员妥善保管相关票据。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.学习资料由经济管理学院统一安排，免费提供。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>优秀学员评选</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pAu73qpwgGkY6P1eSUxjGsrbqwC8cV9SCcf5D61YFc2cthUqEyPNyTWr4bTbJ1XGBqTOssSK32nvpZshoiaKvBm5rMrY5PxIsywOgribUox28/640?wx_fmt=png